Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.05,0:00:06.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We’re finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:10.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,After being stuck inside the bus for two hours.{After jarring inside the bus for two hours} {HA: After being stuck inside the bus for two hours,}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.37,0:00:12.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There it is!{There it is/I see it.}{HA: I can see it!}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:14.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The beach!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.15,0:00:34.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Two nights and three days of summer until school again. {HA: Two nights and three days until? summer school.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.64,0:00:39.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What should I do about turning into a doll at night?{What to do about turning into a doll at night...}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.20,0:00:41.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.19,0:00:44.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Anyways, it’s the beach!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.37,0:02:36.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.78,0:02:40.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let's split up into groups and make some curry.{Lets split up in groups and make some curry.}{HA: Let's split up into groups and make some curry.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.98,0:02:45.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Since the homeroom teacher is ill, I'll sample the food instead.{In substitute of the ill homeroom teacher, I’ll sample the food.}{HA: The homeroom teacher is ill, so I'll sample the food.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.65,0:02:48.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So please make them tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.05,0:02:49.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.29,0:02:52.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,My heart is at ease since Flora-chan is in the same group. {HA: I'm so happy that Furora-chan is in the same group.} {HA: Note: My heart is at ease would be her being happy, right?} {Changed Furora to Flora here for consistency. If you wanna change this back, you're gonna wanna change a Flora have later on to Furora. - Waku}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.55,0:02:54.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Leave the cooking to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.35,0:02:57.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I always make it with my papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:02:59.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s try our best, Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.31,0:03:03.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We’re all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.63,0:03:05.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, I’ll start the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.91,0:03:09.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Should Yayoi and Nao-chan cut the vegetables?{Yayoi and Nao-chan should cut vegetables.}{HA: Should Yayoi and Nao-chan cut the vegetables?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:10.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:13.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Alright then Tsuwabuki, you help cook the rice with Yuuki. {HA: All right(Allright?) Tsuwabuki, you cook(make?) rice with Yuuki.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.35,0:03:16.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,With Yuuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.02,0:03:18.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Can you lift it there a bit, Yayoi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.62,0:03:19.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:23.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Then let's build the rice. {HA: Allright, let's build the rice.} {*Japanese people use the verb “build” in place of “cook” when talking about cooking rice.} {Then let's change it cook, like a correct translation would! - Waku}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:25.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Build?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.99,0:03:36.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuki, what’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.07,0:03:42.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The word "build" is used when constructing buildings or poems. But this is something you eat.{HA: But... if we're going to eat this... (just another way of saying it)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:50.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Then, what do you mean... when you say let's build the rice?{Then what do you mean build the rice?} {HA: Then... what do you mean... when you say we will build the rice?} {...Ah, or not. A trap. I see! - Waku}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.35,0:03:52.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, what it means... {HA: Well, what i mean is...}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:05.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Oh yeah, Yuuki is a Stellar Spinear from Figurare.{Right, Yuuki is a Stellaspinia from Pigellale (check on names please)} {HA: Oh yeah, Yuuki is a Stellaspinia from Pigellale.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.23,0:04:09.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She probably has never "built" rice before.{Probably never has built rice before.} {HA: She probobly has never built rice.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.76,0:04:12.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I don't understand.{I can’t comprehend.}{HA: I don't understand.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.82,0:04:15.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,To build rice means to cook rice. {HA: To "build" rice means to cook it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.00,0:04:20.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Cook? Then it should be spoken as "to cook," shouldn’t it? {HA: Cook? Don't you mean "to cook"?}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.89,0:04:22.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why say build? {HA: Why do/would you say build?}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.24,0:04:25.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That’s true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.58,0:04:27.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, just leave it as "build".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.91,0:04:29.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I still don't understand.{I can’t acknowledge it.}{HA: I still don't understand/ I don't understand.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.17,0:04:34.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Then observe, I’ll do it. {HA: Then watch me while I do it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:39.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's my job too, so I'll try it.{This is my duty also, so I’ll try it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.25,0:04:44.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Please teach me how.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:52.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-ku- {HA: Tsuwabuki-ku-...}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.74,0:04:57.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Stir the rice under water, then pour it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.49,0:05:04.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:08.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.22,0:05:14.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yuuki, don’t pour out the rice! {HA: Y-Yuuki! Don't pour out the rice!}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:15.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But you said to pour it out!{You said pour it out!}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.92,0:05:17.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Just pour out the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.49,0:05:19.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What will you do if you pour out the rice too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.49,0:05:23.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You should have told me something important like that beforehand.{Important things like that should be told beforehand.}{HA: You should have told me that beforehand/earlier.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.83,0:05:50.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wasn’t the meal delicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:52.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I ate too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.09,0:06:01.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.25,0:06:05.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You see, he remarkably...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:09.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What? Stop teasing and just tell me.{What? Stop teasing and just say it.}{HA: Oh come on, Stop teasing me and out with it!}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.02,0:06:11.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Using the road would draw attention...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:40.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.31,0:06:42.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Owww...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.14,0:06:46.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Someone will see us! {HA Someone will see us!}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.80,0:06:50.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, Yuki-chan!{Yuki-chan, amazing.} {HA: Wow, Yuki-chan!}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.83,0:06:53.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,How did you know I was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.23,0:06:55.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That’s...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.98,0:06:58.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Was there any response from the ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:04.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I see... Hoshigaoka is pretty far away...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:07.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan, you're all dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.56,0:07:09.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I fell earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.29,0:07:11.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Want to take a bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:16.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay, somethi-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.34,0:07:23.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But it will stain if you don't bathe soon.{But if you don’t wash soon it will stain.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.61,0:07:25.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay! And think...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.93,0:07:28.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,it'll look strange bringing a doll into the bathroom.{It will be odd to bring a doll into the bathroom} {HA: It would look strange bringing a doll into a bathroom.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:29.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:32.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-tan! Let's all take a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.53,0:07:34.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What’s that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:37.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wow! It’s so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.02,0:07:38.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Is it Sumomo-tan’s? {HA: Is it yours?}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.74,0:07:41.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It got dirty so I was going to wash it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.39,0:07:54.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Good view, good view!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.48,0:07:58.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Toua! You’re in plain sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:08:01.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay! Akino should come here too. {HA: It's/I'm Fine! You should stand? here too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:04.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:07.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I said come here! It’s fine! {HA: Come here! It's fine!}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.13,0:08:11.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, you brought the doll with you?{Sumomo, you brought the doll here.}{HA: you brought your doll in here.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.03,0:08:14.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No, Yuki-chan came here on his own.{No, Yuki-chan came here by himself.}{HA: No, he came by himself.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.05,0:08:17.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The doll came... on its own? {HA: It came.. on it's own?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.02,0:08:19.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Mysterious isn’t it? {HA: Strange, huh?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:22.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It really is a mysterious sheep doll. {HA: What a mysterious Sheep Doll.} {Also possible: "It really is a mysterious sheep doll." - Waku}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:33.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,S-Surely I won’t suddenly turn back into human, will I? {HA: Surely I won't turn into a human suddenly...?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:40.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This feels great! {HA: This feels great!}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.18,0:08:40.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:47.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? {HA: Are you allright?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.46,0:08:50.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I-It surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.05,0:08:53.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But because of Non-tan’s breast catch I was saved! {...lol}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.60,0:08:56.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Breast catch...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.61,0:08:59.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Noboku, did they grow again? {HA: Nobuko, did they grow again?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.55,0:09:01.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It’s still the same, F-cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.89,0:09:04.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Lucky, I’m jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.74,0:09:08.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There, there.{It’s ok, It’s ok.}{HA: There, there.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:11.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan will get bigger too. {HA: You'll get bigger too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.81,0:09:14.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I hope so...{I wish so...}{HA: I hope so...}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.54,0:09:29.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:42.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Preparations okay! {HA: We're/It's ready.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.26,0:09:43.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Canned juice okay! {HA: Juice Cans!} {ideas?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.73,0:09:46.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Cookies check.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:50.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Alright! And now let the pajama party begin! {HA: Alright! Let the pajama party commence/begin!}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.71,0:09:55.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.61,0:09:58.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Spine-chilling horror experience stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.92,0:10:01.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nobuko, these situations are for telling love stories. {HA: we should tell love stories.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:04.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Obviously, we should tell love stories.{Obviously it should be love stories.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.72,0:10:06.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right? Yuuki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:08.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I-Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.80,0:10:10.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, love stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.56,0:10:13.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Anyone with a boyfriend? {HA: Who's got a boyfriend?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.75,0:10:18.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No one has one...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.72,0:10:21.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let's talk about what types we like, then. {HA: Let's talk about what types we like, then.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:24.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nobuko-san, what kind of person do you like? {HA: what kind of person do you like?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:26.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.41,0:10:31.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I like someone who treasures me the most. {HA: I guess i would like someone who treasures me the most.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:34.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.06,0:10:34.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.44,0:10:39.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I guess girls like these kind of stories. {HA: I guess girls like this kind of story?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:45.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey, I want to hear Nako-san’s story. {HA: I wanna hear Nako-san's story.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.72,0:10:48.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Then Yaeno-san, is there someone you like? {HA: Alright Yaeno-san, who do you like?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:50.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No one yet, but... {HA: No one yet, but...}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.46,0:10:52.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I do want to fall in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.62,0:10:57.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If there is someone you love sincerely... {HA: If there is someone you love sincerely...}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.94,0:10:59.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I think you would be happy. {HA: Then you should be happy.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:02.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It seems so... {HA: That seems correct...}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.12,0:11:06.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If I were to think of that person, my heart would start pounding.{If I think of that person my heart starts pounding,}{HA: When i think of that person, my heart starts pounding,}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.01,0:11:08.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It would be fun everyday.{It gets fun everyday.}{HA: needs rewording}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.14,0:11:11.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.41,0:11:19.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan, looks like you’re in love. {HA: looks like you're in love.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.71,0:11:21.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There is someone, right? Someone you like. {HA: There's someone, right? Someone you like.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.75,0:11:24.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Who is it, who is it? Tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.78,0:11:27.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Someone from our school? Same class?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.75,0:11:29.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Now now, come on.{Now now, hurry.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.44,0:11:33.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Spill it. We’ll help you out. {HA: Out with it all. We'll help you out.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:40.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.35,0:11:42.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Is everyone sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.81,0:11:43.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.26,0:11:49.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Somehow it looks like a lot of fun.{Somehow it looks very fun.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.17,0:11:53.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But it’s time to sleep, so everyone please return to your rooms. {HA: your rooms.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.39,0:11:55.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...{Yes.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.63,0:12:09.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Akihime has someone she likes...{Akihime had someone who she likes...}{HA: Akihime said she likes someone...}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.78,0:12:33.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t look too well, Tsuwabuki-kun. {HA: You don't look so good, Tsuwabuki-kun.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.35,0:12:34.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What happened? {HA: What's up? / What's wrong?}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.86,0:12:36.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just tired. {HA: I'm just tired.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.57,0:12:40.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I was very nervous that my doll form would get found out yesterday. {HA: I was afraid that I would get figured out yesterday.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.94,0:12:47.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Is that all?{That is all?}{HA: Is that all?}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:49.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yep, that's all.{That is all.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.12,0:12:51.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.27,0:12:54.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, tonight's the first day of the month, so you won't transform. {HA: Well, tonight being the first of the month, you won't transform.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.34,0:12:58.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There is going to be a courage test, so rest well. {HA: There will be a courage test, so get some rest.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.95,0:12:59.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well then... {HA: Well then...}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.42,0:13:15.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn’t matter who Akihime likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.57,0:13:21.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.89,0:13:26.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Male students who are taking the courage test, draw from the raffle to pick their partners. {HA: Guys taking the courage test need to pick a partner from the raffle.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.77,0:13:29.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.15,0:13:30.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun...{,}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.43,0:13:34.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:39.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sakuraba said that you slept because you were sick.{Sakuraba said that your body was ill so you slept.}{HA: Sakuraba said you slept because you were sick}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.93,0:13:42.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.{I’m ok.}{HA: I'm fine.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.25,0:13:43.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That’s a relief. {HA: That's a relief... / I'm glad...}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:44.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:46.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.93,0:13:55.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime-san! You’re partnered with me, pleased to work with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.11,0:13:57.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Pleased to work with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.98,0:14:07.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Yuuki again...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.30,0:14:17.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.88,0:14:20.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuki is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:23.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.20,0:14:27.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.48,0:14:32.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wonder what's wrong. She hadn't said anything earlier.{I wonder what's wrong. She haven’t spoken earlier either.} {HA: She wasn't speaking earlier either.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.63,0:14:35.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Did I... make her mad? {HA: Err... Did I make her mad?}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.80,0:14:53.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuki, by any chance, are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:56.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No, of course not...{Surely, there is no way...}{HA: No, Of course not...}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.51,0:15:05.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Alright! Big success!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:07.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuki-san, nice reaction!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.47,0:15:10.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But, Tsuwabuki-kun didn’t look scared at all. {HA: But... Tsuwabuki-kun didn't look scared at all.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.73,0:15:13.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it wasn't real.{I know that it’s fake ghosts.}{HA: I knew it wasn't real.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.71,0:15:15.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,He’s no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.26,0:15:17.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Flora, Yaeno-san, let's go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.71,0:15:18.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.81,0:15:19.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.23,0:15:24.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuki, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.33,0:15:25.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I’m fine, something like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:31.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.90,0:15:34.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.57,0:15:37.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,W-Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.14,0:15:43.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If you can’t stand up, I’ll give you a ride. {HA: If you can't walk, I'll give you a ride.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:45.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine!{It’s ok!} {HA: I'm fine!}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.25,0:15:47.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It would be better than just staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.77,0:16:01.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I-I understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.88,0:16:22.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Is it here? Or maybe there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.18,0:16:24.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,How about here?{It seems like here...}{HA: How about here...}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.06,0:16:38.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I’m fine now, please let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.83,0:16:46.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,U-Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:48.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I have a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:50.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.87,0:16:53.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Please keep this a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.19,0:16:57.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I got it. {HA: Sure thing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.44,0:17:04.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru! {HA: Hello? / Hooray!?}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:06.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thank God...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:08.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That was really dangerous.{Really it was dangerous.}{HA: That was really dangerous.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.73,0:17:12.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a single road. So how exactly did you get lost? {HA: how exactly did you get lost?}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:15.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I have no excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:18.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Of course, Yuuki-san...{Undoubtedly Yuuki-san...} {HA: Of course... Yuuki-san...}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.90,0:17:20.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's about Tsuwabuki-kun... {HA: It's about Tsuwabuki...}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:25.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And Tsuwabuki-kun about Yuuki-san... {It's about Tsuwabuki-kun and Yuuki-san.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.88,0:17:33.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:50.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She was...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:53.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She was...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.20,0:17:55.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}...avoiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.31,0:18:20.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Akihime...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.77,0:18:40.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why does it have to be the first day of the month tonight? {HA: Why must it be the first of the month? <-- needed shortening.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:51.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.35,0:18:54.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.70,0:18:59.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun? I didn’t know you were here...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.78,0:19:14.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,W-Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.20,0:19:21.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I-I couldn’t fall asleep, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.34,0:19:24.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Me neither.{Me too... }{HA: Me either...}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.04,0:19:36.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The stars...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.04,0:19:36.18,Nanatsuiro[Default2],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.71,0:19:46.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,B-Because it’s the first day of the month...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.52,0:19:54.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The stars are easy to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.02,0:19:55.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.63,0:20:01.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,They really are!{It really it.}{HA: They really do!(?) You're right!(?)} {HA: lol i couldn't decide}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:07.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The twinkling looks as if they're talking to each other.{It looks like they are talking to each other while twinkling...} {HA: The twinkling looks as if they are talking to eachother}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.92,0:20:19.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. I said something weird.{I’m sorry, for saying something weird.}{HA: S-Sorry! I said something wierd.}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.01,0:20:20.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's funny, isn’t it? {HA: Funny, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.81,0:20:23.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, not at all.{N-No, that’s not true.}{HA: N-No... Not at all.}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.80,0:20:29.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, I know why the stars twinkle.{For me I know why the stars twinkle.}{HA: Actually, I know why the stars twinkle.}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.97,0:20:35.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Although it may not look like that to me, like how the stars are talking...{It doesn’t look like that to me, like how the stars are talking... }{HA: It doesn't look to me like the stars are talking...} {HA: This sounds like he's trying to be mean by directly negating her comment...}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.77,0:20:40.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,To be able to see it like that, I think is incredible. {HA: Original Line}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:46.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,S-Something like that isn’t incredible at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:50.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.21,0:20:58.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That star’s light...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.65,0:21:02.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The light you see right now, is very old.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.71,0:21:08.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,For a light from a star to take thousands of years to reach Earth...{For a light from a star to reach Earth takes thousands of years.}{HA It takes thousands of years for the light from a star to reach earth.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.18,0:21:10.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's what I've learned before.{That I have learned before.}{HA: I allready knew that.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:16.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But, the light you see now may be the star's last light.{And so it could be that the star’s light might be it’s last light} {HA: But, the light you see now, may be the star's last light.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.09,0:21:23.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That star might already be gone, and cease to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.30,0:21:26.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Although to tell you the truth, I really don't know...{Although in truth I do not know...}{HA: Although in truth, I do not know...}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.90,0:21:31.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,A-Akihime?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.14,0:21:34.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Oh um, I'm sorry... {HA: ??? I'm sorry...} {HA: she says something else before Gomene}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.73,0:21:37.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.53,0:21:40.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It’s nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.63,0:21:47.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It’s just that... Thinking that star might already be gone, {HA: It's just that... The thought of that star being gone allready.../being gone allready...}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.46,0:21:49.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I became sad.{I got gloomy...} {HA: I got/became sad.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.30,0:21:57.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There is someone, right? Someone you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.37,0:22:07.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.98,0:22:15.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I-I’m sorry. I suddenly started crying...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.34,0:22:20.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.99,0:22:35.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}From that point on, nothing more was said.{From that point on, no more words came out.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.64,0:22:39.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}There was no need for Akihime to apologize. {HA: Akihime didn't need to apologize.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.38,0:22:43.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Akihime did nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.40,0:22:47.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Then, why did I... {HA: Original Line}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.10,0:24:23.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, Sumomo-chan and Tsuwabuki-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.19,0:24:24.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t you guys feel frustrated?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.64,0:24:26.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Like or dislike?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.30,0:24:28.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Which is it? Which?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.28,0:24:29.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.23,0:24:30.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It’s here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.01,0:24:31.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The time of confession!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.23,0:24:32.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Eh!? It’s here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.71,0:24:34.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And so, which is it?
